<main class='wrapper wrapper--sm legal-main'>
  <div class='legal-main__container'>
    <h2 class='main-heading'>Shipping Policy</h2>
    <p class='main-body'>Last updated: June 22, 2026.</p>
    <h3 class='all-caps legal-main__sub-heading'>Shipping Within Canada</h3>
    <p class='main-body'>
      We ship domestically using Canada Post’s Expedited Parcel service.
    </p>
    <ul class='main-body'>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Shipping Rates:</span>
        <br>
        Orders of $149 CAD or more qualify for free shipping.
        <br>
        Orders under $149 CAD ship at a flat rate of $12.99 CAD.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Estimated Delivery Time:</span>
        <br>
        Orders typically arrive within 2–10 business days, including order
        processing and carrier transit time. Actual delivery timing depends on
        destination and local conditions.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'
          >Delivery to PO Boxes or Remote Areas:</span
        >
        <br>
        Shipments to PO Boxes and remote locations may take additional time.
        These timelines are determined by Canada Post’s network.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3 class='all-caps legal-main__sub-heading'>
      Local Delivery (Greater Toronto Area)
    </h3>
    <p class='main-body'>
      Eligible addresses within select postal codes in the Greater Toronto Area
      will automatically be offered same-day or next-day local delivery during
      checkout.
    </p>
    <ul class='main-body'>
      <li>Local delivery is fulfilled via our third-party courier partner</li>
      <li>
        Availability is based on postal code and appears at checkout only if
        your address qualifies
      </li>
      <li>
        Orders must be placed before the local cutoff time (10am ET) for
        same-day delivery
      </li>
      <li>
        Standard shipping is still available as an alternative at checkout
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3 class='all-caps legal-main__sub-heading'>Shipping to the U.S.</h3>
    <p class='main-body'>
      We offer shipping to the United States via FedEx International Priority®,
      with tracking provided as soon as your order is dispatched.
    </p>
    <ul class='main-body'>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Shipping Rates:</span>
        <br>
        Shipping rates are calculated at checkout based on your delivery address
        and our preferred shipping service: FedEx International Priority®.<br>
        If real-time calculated rates are temporarily unavailable, a fallback
        shipping rate may be shown at checkout. This fallback rate is a standard
        rate we’ve set based on an average of shipping costs to key U.S.
        destinations.
        <br>
        <span class='is--emphasized'
          >Why U.S. shipping rates can be higher:</span
        >
        We currently exclusively ship U.S. orders via FedEx International
        Priority® because it has proven to be the most reliable option for
        getting packages across the border in a timely and predictable manner.
        This predictability comes at a premium and rates may appear higher than
        other services—the rate is presented at checkout as it is offered to us
        without any additional markup.<br>
        We’ve moved to this service after experiencing an increase in returned
        shipments with other carriers/services, and this approach has been
        consistent and reliable for our U.S. customers.
        <br>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Shipping Protection (Insurance):</span>
        Your shipping total also includes a 2% shipping protection fee to insure
        your package against loss or damage in transit. We use ShipStation’s
        Total Shipping Protection powered by XCover for this coverage. Learn
        more:
        <a
          rel='external nofollow'
          target='_blank'
          href='https://www.shipstation.com/partners/xcover/'
          >https://www.shipstation.com/partners/xcover/</a
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Duties & Taxes (Not Included):</span>
        <br>
        U.S. orders are shipped without duties and taxes included at checkout.
        Import duties, taxes, brokerage fees, and any other charges assessed by
        U.S. Customs or FedEx are the customer’s responsibility and are
        typically collected by the carrier prior to delivery or upon delivery.
        <br>
        If a shipment is refused or duties/taxes are not paid, FedEx may return
        or abandon the package. In these cases, any return shipping costs, fees,
        or charges billed back to us may be deducted from your refund (where
        applicable).
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Estimated Delivery Time:</span>
        <br>
        Estimated delivery timing is shown at checkout, typically arriving
        within 1–3 business days, including order processing. Carrier transit
        time begins once your order has been dispatched. Please note that
        carrier transit times are estimates and are not guaranteed. Delivery may
        be affected by customs processing, weather, peak periods, or other
        carrier delays.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Service Area:</span>
        <br>
        At this time, we only ship to select U.S. states. If your address falls
        outside our service area, you won’t be able to complete checkout.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3 class='all-caps legal-main__sub-heading'>Shipping to the U.A.E.</h3>
    <p class='main-body'>
      We offer shipping to the United Arab Emirates via FedEx International
      Priority®, with tracking provided as soon as your order is dispatched.
    </p>
    <ul class='main-body'>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Shipping Rates:</span>
        <br>
        Shipping rates are calculated at checkout based on your delivery
        address.
        <br>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Shipping Protection (Insurance):</span>
        Your shipping total also includes a 2% shipping protection fee to insure
        your package against loss or damage in transit. We use ShipStation’s
        Total Shipping Protection powered by XCover for this coverage. Learn
        more:
        <a
          rel='external nofollow'
          target='_blank'
          href='https://www.shipstation.com/partners/xcover/'
          >https://www.shipstation.com/partners/xcover/</a
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Duties & Taxes (Not Included):</span>
        <br>
        U.A.E. orders are shipped without duties and taxes included at checkout.
        Import duties, taxes, brokerage fees, and any other charges assessed by
        U.A.E. Customs or FedEx are the customer’s responsibility and are
        typically collected by the carrier prior to delivery or upon delivery.
        <br>
        If a shipment is refused or duties/taxes are not paid, FedEx may return
        or abandon the package. In these cases, any return shipping costs, fees,
        or charges billed back to us may be deducted from your refund (where
        applicable).
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Estimated Delivery Time:</span>
        <br>
        Estimated delivery timing is shown at checkout, typically arriving
        within 3–5 business days, including order processing. Carrier transit
        time begins once your order has been dispatched. Please note that
        carrier transit times are estimates and are not guaranteed. Delivery may
        be affected by customs processing, weather, peak periods, or other
        carrier delays.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Service Area:</span>
        <br>
        At this time, we only ship to Dubai. If your address falls outside our
        service area, you won’t be able to complete checkout.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3 class='all-caps legal-main__sub-heading'>
      General Shipping Information
    </h3>
    <ul class='main-body'>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Customs Delays:</span>
        <br>
        International shipments may be subject to customs inspections and
        clearance procedures. Rewind Skin is not responsible for delays caused
        by customs processing or carrier issues once the order has left our
        facility.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Canadian Holidays:</span>
        <br>
        Our fulfilment centre operates on Canadian statutory holidays. Orders
        placed around these dates may experience minor delays in processing and
        dispatch.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class='legal-main__container'>
    <h2 class='main-heading' id='returns'>Returns Policy</h2>
    <p class='main-body'>Last updated: June 22, 2026.</p>
    <p class='main-body'>
      We understand that there may come a time to return a purchase and we aim
      to make the returns process as simple as possible.
    </p>
    <p class='main-body'>
      {% comment %} Need to manually switch "purchase date" to "receipt" {% endcomment %}
      If you're looking to return or exchange your order, we offer returns
      within 7 days of receipt. You can return your product for store credit or
      a different product.
    </p>
    <p class='main-body'>
      Please note: We are committed to handling returns fairly. However, due to
      the nature of our products, all returns are evaluated individually and are
      subject to our discretion. To qualify for a return, products must be in
      their original, unopened, and unused condition. In instances of an
      allergic reaction to any of our products, customers are required to
      provide visual documentation of the reaction to facilitate the return
      process.
    </p>
    <ul class='main-body'>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Restocking Fee:</span>
        <br>
        A restocking fee of $25 CAD is deducted from any store credit or
        exchange issued. For orders placed in other currencies, this amount is
        converted at the prevailing exchange rate at the time of processing.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class='is--emphasized'>Gift Cards:</span>
        <br>
        All gift card purchases are final sale and are not eligible for return,
        exchange, or refund. If a gift card was purchased for an in-studio
        treatment and the recipient is unable to visit in person, we may be able
        to transfer the value to an e-commerce credit on a case-by-case basis.
        Please contact us at hello@rewindskinco.com to discuss.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class='legal-main__container'>
    <h3 class='all-caps legal-main__sub-heading'>Return Process</h3>
    <p class='main-body'>
      To return an item, email us at hello@rewindskinco.com with your Order
      Number and return reason and our support team will be happy to assist you
      with the next steps.
    </p>
    <p class='main-body'>
      You will be responsible for any return shipping charges.
    </p>
    <p class='main-body'>
      <span class='is--emphasized'>Return Address:</span>
      <br>
      Rewind Skin Co.
      <br>
      20 Donewen Ct
      <br>
      North York ON M4A 1P8
      <br>
      Canada
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class='legal-main__container'>
    <h3 class='all-caps legal-main__sub-heading'>Store Credit or Exchanges</h3>
    <p class='main-body'>
      After receiving your item/s and inspecting the condition, we will process
      your refund or exchange. Please allow at least 3 to 5 business days from
      the receipt of your item/s for your return to be processed.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class='legal-main__container'>
    <h3 class='all-caps legal-main__sub-heading'>Questions</h3>
    <p class='main-body'>
      For questions relating to our returns policy, please contact us at
      hello@rewindskinco.com
    </p>
  </div>
</main>
